   "widgets_values": [
    "I-Max (FLUX) — dual-pass resolution extrapolation.\n\n1. Load FLUX-dev (UNET + Dual CLIP + VAE ae.safetensors).\n2. EmptySD3LatentImage at the TARGET resolution (2K/4K) -> I-Max.\n3. I-Max runs its own low-res guidance pass and the target pass\n   (steps_low 30 + steps_high 20) - no KSampler, no DyPE node.\n4. Decode the High-Res Latent.\n\nPaper defaults: time_shift 3.0/6.0, ntk_factor 10, dwt_level 1."
   ],
   "title": "I-Max example workflow"
